[{"id":17217,"date":"2023-01-24T15:08:25","date_gmt":"2023-01-24T15:08:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=17217"},"modified":"2023-06-07T09:49:30","modified_gmt":"2023-06-07T13:49:30","slug":"trading-for-hydradx-hdx-starts-january-24-deposit-now","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/trading-for-hydradx-hdx-starts-january-24-deposit-now","title":{"rendered":"Trading for HydraDX (HDX) starts January 24 &#8211; deposit now!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports <\/span><b>HydraDX (HDX)<\/b><b>!<\/b><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and trading<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>Please note that HDX funding and trading are live. <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can add these tokens to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting the asset, and hitting <\/span><b>Deposit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Already have HDX and a Kraken account? Click below to get started \u2935\ufe0f<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/hdx-listing-blog-1\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deposit now<\/a><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HDX <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">tokens are tradeable on <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and the <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/\">Kraken Pro<\/a>\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">interface with the following parameters:<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ticker<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HDX<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tradeable against<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">USD, EUR<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Price precision<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3 decimal places<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Order minimum<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10 HDX<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Deposit minimum\u00a0<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5 HDX<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Not available in\u00a0<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">United States, Canada and Japan<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><\/td>\n<td><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><b>Note:\u00a0<\/b><b>Trading via Kraken App and Instant Buy will be available once the liquidity conditions are met<\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market for their orders to be efficiently matched).<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know about the project:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>HydraDX (HDX)\u00a0<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HydraDX is a community-driven, cross-chain liquidity protocol. The protocol is designed to communicate with independent networks and enable liquidity for cryptocurrencies via a multi-asset trading pool. HDX is the native asset of the platform which is used to reduce trading fees, earn rewards for securing the network via staking and vote on decisions that affect the future of the project.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Ready to deposit but don&#8217;t have a Kraken account yet? <\/i><\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\"><b><i>Sign up today<\/i><\/b><\/a><b><i>!<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/hdx-listing-blog-2\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get started<\/a><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>\n<h3><\/h3>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken make more assets available?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 including which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s available tokens can be found <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be making available in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee a market order will execute at a certain price. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/referrals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"15784\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/subhead_reflink-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1200%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,250\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-met