the speed and reduce the costs and complexities of transactions on its network. Polygon is a sidechain which [&hellip;]","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/dai-usdc-and-usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2023-01-25T14:14:05+00:00","article_modified_time":"2023-10-31T17:29:51+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1536,"height":700,"url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/NewNetworkSupport_Social_BlogInner-1.png?fit=1536%2C700&ssl=1","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"KrakenFX","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"KrakenFX","Est. reading time":"3 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/dai-usdc-and-usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/dai-usdc-and-usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network"},"author":{"name":"KrakenFX","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/05fd1aef04d178f2231400ddb85550a2"},"headline":"DAI, USDC and USDT deposits and withdrawals available on the Polygon Network!","datePublished":"2023-01-25T14:14:05+00:00","dateModified":"2023-10-31T17:29:51+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/dai-usdc-and-usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network"},"wordCount":697,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/dai-usdc-and-usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/NewNetworkSupport_Social_BlogInner-1.png?fit=1536%2C700&ssl=1","keywords":["DAI","matic","USDC","USDT"],"articleSection":["Asset Listings","Product"],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kra