at is the blockchain trilemma? - Kraken Blog","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-image-preview:large","max-video-preview":"max-video-preview:-1"},"canonical":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/crypto-101-what-is-the-blockchain-trilemma","og_locale":"en_US","og_type":"article","og_title":"Crypto 101: What is the blockchain trilemma?","og_description":"Life is full of tradeoffs. Oftentimes, we can only maximize one outcome by sacrificing another. Sometimes these tradeoffs are not exactly 1:1 tradeoffs but are part of a more complex relationship. What are some examples of a trilemma? Realtors might say: a big house, great location, affordable price &#8211; pick two Chefs might say: big [&hellip;]","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/crypto-101-what-is-the-blockchain-trilemma","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2023-01-30T19:00:27+00:00","article_modified_time":"2023-05-09T11:23:47+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1024,"height":591,"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/24Artboard-1-copy-22@2x-1024x591.png","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"krakenfx","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"krakenfx","Est. reading time":"5 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/crypto-101-what-is-the-blockchain-trilemma#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/crypto-101-what-is-the-blockchain-trilemma"},"author":{"name":"krakenfx","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/461b7fbe1832d96cab8eb182c6642a21"},"headline":"Crypto 101: What is the blockchain trilemma?","datePublished":"2023-01-30T19:00:27+00:00","dateModified":"2023-05-09T11:23:47+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/crypto-101-what-is-the-blockchain-trilemma"},"wordCount":995,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"