blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Generate_report_history_1.png?resize=300%2C54&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Generate_report_history_1.png?resize=1024%2C183&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Generate_report_history_1.png?resize=768%2C138&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Generate_report_history_1.png?resize=200%2C36&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Options trade history:<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"17540\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/otc_options_trade_history_1-2\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?fit=1083%2C669&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1083,669\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"OTC_options_trade_history_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?fit=1024%2C633&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-17540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?resize=1083%2C669&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"OTC_options_trade_history_1\" width=\"1083\" height=\"669\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?w=1083&amp;ssl=1 1083w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?resize=300%2C185&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?resize=1024%2C633&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?resize=768%2C474&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_trade_history_1-1.png?resize=162%2C100&amp;ssl=1 162w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Options trade detail:<\/h3>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"17503\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/otc_options_detailed_1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_detailed_1-e1675363684334.png?fit=715%2C418&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"715,418\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"OTC_options_detailed_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_detailed_1-e1675363684334.png?fit=715%2C418&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-17503 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_detailed_1-e1675363684334.png?resize=715%2C418&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"715\" height=\"418\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_detailed_1-e1675363684334.png?w=715&amp;ssl=1 715w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_detailed_1-e1675363684334.png?resize=300%2C175&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/OTC_options_detailed_1-e1675363684334.png?resize=171%2C100&amp;ssl=1 171w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 715px) 100vw, 715px\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>Automated RFQ<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our self-service RFQ allows you to generate your own instant trade quote for $50K+ of any eligible cryptoasset up to a maximum of $1M (which can be increased on a case-by-case basis). New RFQ features include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stablecoin trading: USDT\/USD, USDT\/EUR, USDC\/USDT, USDC\/USD, USDC\/EUR<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quotes available by lot size or by base currency transaction amount<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cMax trade size\u201d and \u201cMax amount\u201d per asset displayed in the UI<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Indicative pricing for OTC clients without RFQ access<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is a maximum number of coins that can be purchased <\/span><b>per trade. <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This maximum can vary and the current limits are always available in the OTC portal FAQ. Even though there are per-trade maximums, an unlimited number of trades can be placed. Eligible assets are shown below:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"17505\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/rfq_asset_list_1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_asset_list_1-e1675363742465.png?fit=423%2C551&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"423,551\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"RFQ_asset_list_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_asset_list_1-e1675363742465.png?fit=423%2C551&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-17505 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_asset_list_1-e1675363742465.png?resize=423%2C551&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"423\" height=\"551\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_asset_list_1-e1675363742465.png?w=423&amp;ssl=1 423w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_asset_list_1-e1675363742465.png?resize=230%2C300&amp;ssl=1 230w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_asset_list_1-e1675363742465.png?resize=77%2C100&amp;ssl=1 77w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 423px) 100vw, 423px\" \/><\/p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Note: Listed max trade sizes are examples only, see the OTC portal FAQ for current max trade sizes<\/span><\/em><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Simply accept your automated buy or sell quote and your trade is filled \u2013 without ever having to worry about navigating fast-moving markets or those for coins that might be less liquid.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"17541\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/rfq_page_1-2\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?fit=1090%2C959&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1090,959\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"RFQ_page_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?fit=1024%2C901&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-17541\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?resize=1090%2C959&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"RFQ_page_1\" width=\"1090\" height=\"959\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?w=1090&amp;ssl=1 1090w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?resize=300%2C264&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?resize=1024%2C901&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?resize=768%2C676&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/RFQ_page_1-1.png?resize=114%2C100&amp;ssl=1 114w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Already a Kraken OTC client? <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/otc\/quote\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Try out the new RFQ and OTC Portal v 2.0 today!<\/span><\/a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019re new to OTC and want to learn more, <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/features\/otc-exchange\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">learn what OTC can do for you<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/otc-rfq\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Try RFQ<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n<hr \/>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, or hold any digital asset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your crypto assets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Note: Since this blog was published, the OTC portal link has moved to the top-of-page navigation: The Kraken OTC desk is constantly exploring new ways to deliver a great trading experience to our clients. Our new, fast, reliable, and easy-to-use automated settlement service seamlessly integrates with our RFQ, providing access to automated trade quotes and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089380,"featured_media":17528,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"templat