.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/","url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1","contentUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1","width":214,"height":64,"caption":"Kraken Blog"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/05fd1aef04d178f2231400ddb85550a2","name":"KrakenFX","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/danielpintokraken"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-4zC","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Blog-Inner-BTC-Genesis.png?fit=1536%2C700&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17584","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089380"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=17584"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17584\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21041,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17584\/revisions\/21041"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/16982"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=17584"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=17584"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=17584"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=17584"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":17619,"date":"2023-02-09T20:24:50","date_gmt":"2023-02-09T20:24:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=17619"},"modified":"2023-05-09T07:54:27","modified_gmt":"2023-05-09T11:54:27","slug":"settlement","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/settlement","title":{"rendered":"Kraken to end on-chain staking services for U.S. clients"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Today, two Kraken subsidiaries announced a settlement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) concerning Kraken&#8217;s on-chain staking program. Because of this settlement, Kraken has agreed to end its on-chain staking services for U.S. clients.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting today, Kraken will automatically unstake all U.S. client assets enrolled in the on-chain staking program. These assets will no longer earn staking rewards. This applies to all staked assets except for staked ether (ETH), which will be unstaked after the Shanghai upgrade. U.S. clients will not be able to stake any additional assets, including ETH.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken will continue to offer staking services for non-U.S. clients through a separate Kraken subsidiary.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>What does this mean for existing staking clients in the U.S.?<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">U.S. clients will not be able to stake new assets.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Previously staked non-ETH assets will be automatically unstaked. These assets will be returned to the client\u2019s spot wallet and will no longer earn rewards.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken will prorate final rewards through February <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">9<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. These rewards will not become staked. Kraken will instead pay rewards out in their non-staked form.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All staked ETH will become unstaked after the Shanghai upgrade and will continue to earn rewards until then. There are no changes to the payout structure until after the Shanghai upgrade, when ETH will be unstaked.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Staking services for non-U.S. clients will continue uninterrupted. Non-U.S. clients can continue to stake and unstake assets, as well as automatically earn and stake rewards, as usual.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For more information, please review our updated <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">terms of service<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or contact <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/215601908-Contacting-Kraken-Support\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Support<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Today, two Kraken subsidiaries announced a settlement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) concerning Kraken&#8217;s on-chain staking program. Because of this settlement, Kraken has agreed to end its on-chain staking services for U.S. clients. Starting today, Kraken will automatically unstake all U.S. client assets enrolled in the on-chain staking program. These assets will [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":21092,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1774],"tags":[1443],"language":[],"class_list":["post-17619","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news","tag-staking"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kraken to end on-chain staking services for U.S. clients - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/settlement\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kraken to end on-chain staking services for U.S. clients\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Today, two Kraken subsidiaries announced a settlement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) concerning Kraken&#8217;s on-chain staking program. Because of this settlement, Kraken has agreed to end its on-chain staking services for U.S. clients. Starting today, Kraken will automatically unstake all U.S. client assets enrolled in the on-chain staking program. These assets will [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/settlement\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-02-09T20:24:50+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-05-09T11:54:27+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/blog-KrakenGeneric.png?fit=1536%2C701&ssl=1\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1536\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"701\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"krakenfx\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"krakenfx\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"1 minute\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/settlement#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/settlement\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"krakenfx\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/461b7fbe1832d96cab8eb182c6642a21\"},\"headline\":\"Kraken to end on-chain staking services for U.S. clients\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-02-09T20:24:50+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-05-09T11:54:27+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/settlement\"},\"wordCount\":274,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/settlement#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\