}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/120066484"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=17619"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17619\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21093,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17619\/revisions\/21093"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/21092"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=17619"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=17619"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=17619"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=17619"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":17590,"date":"2023-02-13T15:36:15","date_gmt":"2023-02-13T15:36:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=17590"},"modified":"2023-06-07T09:49:14","modified_gmt":"2023-06-07T13:49:14","slug":"eth-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-arbitrum","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/eth-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-arbitrum","title":{"rendered":"ETH deposits and withdrawals available on Arbitrum!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports deposits and withdrawals of <\/span><b>Ethereum (ETH) on Arbitrum<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arbitrum is a Layer 2 (L2) blockchain protocol built on top of the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/ethereum\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ethereum<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> blockchain that allows Ethereum transactions to be processed more efficiently.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By increasing the amount of transactions Ethereum can process, as well as the speed with which it can process them, Arbitrum has the additional benefit of reducing transaction costs, known as <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/what-is-a-blockchain-gas-fee\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">gas fees<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, associated with using Ethereum and its various decentralized applications.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arbitrum also allows developers to create and execute their own Ethereum-compatible <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/what-are-smart-contracts\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">smart contracts<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. These can be programmed to run decentralized applications that can interact with the broader Ethereum ecosystem without bogging down the main blockchain\u2019s performance.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding is already live<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> You can transfer Ethereum (ETH) to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting <\/span><b>ETH <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and in the drop-down box the desired deposit method (network): <\/span><b>Arbitrum One Network<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Note: <\/b>ETH deposits and withdrawals on Abritrum via the Kraken Pro App and Kraken App won\u2019t be available at launch.<\/p>\n<p><b><i>Got ETH (Ethereum) on Arbitrum and a Kraken account? <\/i><\/b><b>\u2935\ufe0f<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/eth-on-arbitrum\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deposit now<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know about the assets:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/what-is-ethereum-eth\"><b>Ethereum (ETH)<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a global, open-source platform for decentralized applications. Ethereum is a marketplace of financial services, games and apps that is trustless, decentralized and secure. ETH is the cryptocurrency powering the Ethereum network. It&#8217;s used to pay for transactions, as a store of value or peer-to-peer payment method, or as collateral to generate entirely different crypto tokens that run on Ethereum. Learn how to add ETH to your crypto portfolio with our Learn Center article <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/buy-ethereum-eth\"><b>How to Buy Ethereum (ETH)<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Ready to deposit but don&#8217;t have a Kraken account yet? <\/i><\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\"><b><i>Sign up today<\/i><\/b><\/a><b><i>!\u00a0<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/eth-on-arbitrum-sign-up\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n<h3><\/h3>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken make more assets available?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 including which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s available tokens can be found <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be making available in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee a market order will execute at a certain price. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/referrals\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"15784\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/subhead_reflink-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1200%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,250\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"subhead_reflink (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Referral cta image&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1024%2C213&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"size-full wp-image-15784\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=1200%2C250&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Referral link image\" width=\"1200\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=300%2C63&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=1024%2C213&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=768%2C160&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=200%2C42&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>\n<hr \/>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Geographic restrictions may apply.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>